        "skill2": "Summon an ice field lasting {Duration}s that <#ef5350ff>slows enemies by {MoveSpeed}%<> within {Range} and deals <#a974ffff>{Damage}<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>{Coef}% of ability power<> as <#a974ffff>magic damage<> every {Tick}s. Freezes and <#ef5350ff>stuns enemies for {Stun}s<> when it ends.",
        "ult": "Deal <#a974ffff>{Damage}<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>{Coef}% of ability power<> as <#a974ffff>magic damage<> to enemies in a frontal cone and knock them back. <#ef5350ff>Slow by {Slow}% for {SlowDuration}s<> and <#ef5350ff>block movement skills for {BlockDuration}s<>."
