        "skill": "Fire a projectile, dealing <#a974ffff>{Damage}<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>{Coef}% AP<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and summoning an illusion that <#ef5350ff>taunts for {Time}s<>.",
        "skill2": "Deal <#a974ffff>{Damage}<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>{Coef}% AP<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> to enemies within {Range} and <#ef5350ff>fear for {Time}s<>.",
