        "ult": "For <#ffb900ff>{Duration}s<>, drain <#6aff55ff>{Heal}<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>{HealCoef}% AP<> <#6aff55ff>health<> from enemies within {Range} and deal <#a974ffff>{Damage}<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>{DamageCoef}% AP<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>."
