        "skill": "Fire lightning at a target, dealing <#a974ffff>{Damage}<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>{Coef}% AP<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>. Chains to nearby enemies without duplicating targets.",
