        "ult": "For <#ffb900ff>{Time}s<>, <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:range_0><#ff86c2ff>range increases by {Range}<> and <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:attack_speed_0><#ceff99ff>attack speed increases by {AttackSpeed}%<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>{AttackSpeedCoef}% of ability power<>. Basic attacks trigger the first skill."
