        "ult": "Grant allies within {Range} a <#e8d44dff>shield<> of <#e8d44dff>{Shield}<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>{Coef}% of ability power<>. Shielded allies gain <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>{MoveSpeed}% movement speed<>."
