        "skill2": "Perform a ritual on an ally for <#ffb900ff>{Duration}s<>, increasing <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:range_0><#ff86c2ff>range by {Range}<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>{RangeCoef}% AP<> and adding dash to attacks.",
