        "skill": "Swing a hammer at a nearby enemy to deal <#ff9028ff>{Damage}<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>{Coef}% of attack damage<> as <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> and launch <#ef5350ff>airborne for {Time}s<>.",
        "skill2": "Focus with the hammer raised, then slam the ground to deal <#ff9028ff>{Damage}<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>{Coef}% of attack damage<> as <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> within {Range} and apply <#ef5350ff>{Move}% slow for {Time}s<>.",
        "ult": "Swing the hammer widely, dealing <#ff9028ff>{Damage}<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>{Coef}% of attack damage<> as <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> to all enemies in a semicircular area within {Range} range. Enemies hit are knocked back for {Time}s, and enemy champions hit by the pushed enemy are <#ef5350ff>airborne for {Airborne}s<>."
      },
      "inquisitor": {
        "name": "Inquisitor",
        "skill": "Dash a short distance, dealing <#ff9028ff>{Damage}<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>{Coef}% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> to the first enemy hit and applying <#ef5350ff>bleed<>.",
        "skill2": "Slash a targeted enemy, dealing <#ff9028ff>{Damage}<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>{Coef}% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>. Resets Skill 1 cooldown if <#ef5350ff>bleeding<>.",
        "ult": "Charge toward an enemy champion, dealing <#ff9028ff>{Damage}<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>{Coef}% of attack damage<> as <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> to all enemies in the area upon arrival. Enemies below {Threshold}% max HP after taking damage are executed. On execution, nearby enemies are <#ef5350ff>feared for {FearTime}s<>."
