        "skill2": "Move a short distance, stand on the pole to become untargetable for {Time}s, then swing to deal <#ff9028ff>{Damage}<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>{Coef}% of attack damage<> as <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> to all enemies within {Range}.",
