        "skill2": "Attach a spirit to an enemy for <#ffb900ff>{Duration}s<>, reducing <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:armor_0><#ffdd8eff>armor by {DefDown}<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>{DefCoef}% AP<>, <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:magic resistance_0><#88ccffff>magic resist by {MrDown}<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>{MrCoef}% AP<> and <#ef5350ff>slowing by {Slow}%<>.",
