        "skill": "Charge in a straight line to impale the first hit enemy, <#ef5350ff>rooting for {Time}s<> and dealing <#ff9028ff>{Damage}<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>{Coef}% of attack damage<> as <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>. Charge speed scales with move speed.",
