        "skill2": "Summon an eagle. If it dies, the druid takes damage. Casting while summoned makes the eagle charge at an enemy, dealing <#a974ffff>{Damage}<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>{Coef}% of ability power<> as <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and <#6aff55ff>healing for {Lifesteal}% of damage dealt<>.",
