        "skill": "Kırbacı sallar, <#ff9028ff>{Damage}<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>{Coef}% Saldırı<> <#ff9028ff>fiziksel hasar<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0><#6aff55ff>{HpRatio}% hedef CG<> verir.",
        "skill2": "Kırbacı yelpaze şeklinde sallar, <#ff9028ff>{Damage}<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>{Coef}% Saldırı<> <#ff9028ff>fiziksel hasar<> verir ve düşmanları geri iter.",
