        "skill": "Hace girar el látigo, causando <#ff9028ff>{Damage}<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>{Coef}% AD<> de <#ff9028ff>daño físico<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0><#6aff55ff>{HpRatio}% del HP del objetivo<>.",
