        "ult": "Pendant <#ffb900ff>{Duration}s<>, draine <#6aff55ff>{Heal}<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>{HealCoef}% PM<> de <#6aff55ff>vie<> aux ennemis dans {Range} et inflige <#a974ffff>{Damage}<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>{DamageCoef}% PM<> de <#a974ffff>dégâts magiques<>."
