        "skill2": "用钩子撕裂1名敌人，造成<#ff9028ff>{Damage}<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>攻击力的{Coef}%<>的<#ff9028ff>物理伤害<>，并使其<#ef5350ff>出血{Duration}秒<>。出血伤害每{Tick}秒造成<#ff9028ff>{TickDamage}<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>攻击力的{TickCoef}%<>的<#ff9028ff>物理伤害<>，并使其<#ef5350ff>受到伤害提高{Debuff}%<>。",
