        "skill2": "{Time}秒內變身為大惡魔。變身為大惡魔期間<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>攻擊力增加{Attack}<>，<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:armor_0><#ffdd8eff>護甲增加{Defense}<>，<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:attack_speed_0><#ceff99ff>攻擊速度增加{AttackSpeed}%<>，<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>移動速度增加{MoveSpeed}%<>。",
