        "skill": "<#6aff55ff>恢復<>周圍{Range}範圍內盟友的<#6aff55ff>{Value}<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>法術強度的{Coef}%<>生命值。只恢復自己時恢復量上升到<#6aff55ff>{SingleValue}<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>法術強度的{Coef}%<>。",
