        "ult": "為{Range}範圍內的友軍賦予<#e8d44dff>{Shield}<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>法術強度的{Coef}%<>的<#e8d44dff>護盾<>。獲得護盾的友軍<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>移動速度提高{MoveSpeed}%<>。"
