        "skill": "召喚食屍鬼作為僕從，持續<#ffb900ff>{Duration}(+法術強度的{DurationCoef}%)秒<>。隨等級降低技能冷卻，並使食屍鬼持續時間每級增加<#ffb900ff>{DurationPerLevel}秒<>。",
        "skill2": "將一個敵人指定為攻擊目標，持續<#ffb900ff>{Time}秒<>，使食屍鬼狂暴。食屍鬼的<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:attack_speed_0><#ceff99ff>攻擊速度提高{AttackSpeed}%<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>法術強度的{AttackSpeedCoef}%<>，<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>移動速度提高{MoveSpeed}%<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>法術強度的{MoveSpeedCoef}%<>。",
